  "title": "Clean Air - Cross Party Group",
  "purpose": "Poor air quality continues to have a significant impact on respiratory health. Air pollution is associated with a range of health conditions, including asthma, COPD, cardiovascular disease but also can cause Alzheimer’s, contribute to diabetes and damage mental health. Air pollution is responsible for 2,000 deaths per year in Wales. The Cross-Party Group will bring together Members and interested stakeholders to take action to improve air quality.",
